---
// Step 8: controls bound to the learner's code in the playground (see learn/playground.ts, `data-control`).
---

<div class="learn-controls">
  <label class="wide">
    <span>System text</span>
    <textarea data-control="system" rows="2"></textarea>
    <small>The <code>const system</code> line of agent.ts. Code, never stored: the next prompt starts with the new text.</small>
  </label>
  <label>
    <span>Messages memory keeps</span>
    <input type="number" min="0" step="1" data-control="lastN" />
    <small>The last line of memory.ts: 0 keeps every message; 2 adds <code>.slice(-2)</code>.</small>
  </label>
</div>
<p class="learn-note" data-controls-note hidden>
  A control is greyed out when its line is missing from your code. Press Reset in the Code pane to bring it back.
</p>
